-- Seed: coding problems for the Full Stack course, inserted as DRAFTS (publish them in Admin → Coding problems).
-- Every problem was verified against LeetCode / HackerRank public APIs on 2026-10-02 (exact title, difficulty, free).
-- Idempotent: re-running skips existing (course, url) rows. Skipped silently if the course or a module is missing.
